<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Energy Home Appliances — home appliances, air-conditioning and servicing in Malta."><title>Privacy Policy · Energy Home Appliances</title><link rel="icon" href="assets/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><div class="container nav-row"><a class="logo-link" href="index.html"><img src="assets/eha-logo-teal.png" alt="Energy Home Appliances — Turning Houses into Homes"></a><nav class="nav"><a class="" href="index.html">Home</a><a class="" href="products.html">Products</a><a class="" href="contact.html">Contact</a></nav><a class="wa-button header-wa" href="https://wa.me/35679567978?text=Hi%21%20I%20would%20like%20more%20information%20about%20Energy%20Home%20Appliances." target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="wa-icon">◔</span> CONTACT US</a><button class="menu-button" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button></div><div class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav"><a class="" href="index.html">Home</a><a class="" href="products.html">Products</a><a class="" href="contact.html">Contact</a><a class="wa-button" href="https://wa.me/35679567978?text=Hi%21%20I%20would%20like%20more%20information%20about%20Energy%20Home%20Appliances." target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="wa-icon">◔</span> CONTACT US</a></div></header><main><section class="page-intro"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow teal">LEGAL</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></section><section class="section legal"><div class="container"><h2>Information we may receive</h2><p>When you contact Energy Home Appliances by email, WhatsApp, telephone or through another direct contact route, you may share your name, contact details, product interest and message.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to your enquiry, provide product or servicing information and continue the conversation you requested. It is not used for online checkout because this website is a catalogue, not an e-commerce shop.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>WhatsApp, Facebook and Google Maps are external services with their own privacy practices. Their services may process information according to their policies.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>You may ask what personal information is held about you, request correction or deletion where applicable, and object to processing where the law permits. You may also lodge a complaint with Malta’s Information and Data Protection Commissioner.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>This policy should be reviewed and updated if analytics, cookies, marketing tools, hosting providers or other data-processing services are added to the finished website.</p></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-main"><div><img src="assets/eha-logo-white.png" class="footer-logo" alt="Energy Home Appliances"><p>Turning Houses into Homes</p></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><a href="tel:+35679567978">7956 7978</a><a href="mailto:energyhomespb@outlook.com">energyhomespb@outlook.com</a><span>472, Triq San Pawl<br>San Pawl il-Baħar, Malta<br>SPB 3431</span></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="products.html">Products</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a><a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a></div><div><h3>Connect</h3><a href="https://www.facebook.com/EnergyHomeAppliances" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook ↗</a><a class="wa-button" href="https://wa.me/35679567978?text=Hi%21%20I%20would%20like%20more%20information%20about%20Energy%20Home%20Appliances." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us ↗</a></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Energy Home Appliances</span><span>Website created by <a href="https://dsmcomms.com/" target="_blank">DSM Communications</a></span></div></footer><script src="site.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/cookie-notice.css">
